### 1. Anonymous User -> GET /Hotels (Expect 401 Unauthorized)
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/hotel-booking/Hotels


### 2. Admin User -> GET /Bookings (Expect 200 - Returns both bookings)
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/hotel-booking/Bookings
Authorization: Basic admin:admin


### 3. Manager User -> GET /Bookings (Expect 200 - Returns both bookings)
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/hotel-booking/Bookings
Authorization: Basic manager:manager


### 4. Manager User -> DELETE /Bookings(<id>) (Expect 403 Forbidden)
DELETE http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/hotel-booking/Bookings(dddddddd-0000-0000-0000-000000000001)
Authorization: Basic manager:manager


### 5. Saba User -> GET /Bookings (Expect 200 - Only his booking dddddddd-...0001)
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/hotel-booking/Bookings
Authorization: Basic saba:saba


### 6. Saba User -> GET /Guests (Expect 200 - Only his guest record)
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/hotel-booking/Guests
Authorization: Basic saba:saba


### 7a. Saba -> create DRAFT booking
# @name createDraft
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/hotel-booking/Bookings
Authorization: Basic saba:saba
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "room_ID": "aaaaaaa1-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "guest_ID": "cccccccc-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "checkIn": "2026-12-20",
  "checkOut": "2026-12-23"
}


### 7b. Saba -> ACTIVATE the draft (handlers run here: validation, overlap check, price, guest forced to Saba)
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/hotel-booking/Bookings(ID={{createDraft.response.body.ID}},IsActiveEntity=false)/HotelBookingService.draftActivate
Authorization: Basic saba:saba
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 8. Saba User -> GET /Hotels (Expect 200 Allowed)
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/hotel-booking/Hotels
Authorization: Basic saba:saba


### 9. Saba User -> POST /Hotels (Expect 403 Forbidden)
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/hotel-booking/Hotels
Authorization: Basic saba:saba
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Unauthorized Hotel",
  "city": "Test City"
}